<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST8466"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Superbike7<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Superbike7<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 23, 2005 - 2:11 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I saw on one of the KAKE newsreels that showed case #, victims name and race, it listed Sherry as a black female which I did not know.I had never heard this.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
